# Claude Code: the plan files are project docs — CLAUDE.md, README.md and
# docs/spec.md all point at them, so they have to survive a clone (a web agent
# working from one has no other way to read them). A global ignore of
# `.claude/*` is common and silent; the negations below override it. Everything
# else under .claude/ is per-developer.
.claude/*
!.claude/plans/
!.claude/plans/**
